<title>UK: UK's Harrisons rises on report of break-up.</title>
<headline>UK's Harrisons rises on report of break-up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Harrisons and Crosfield Plc jumped on Monday after a report in the Sunday Times newspaper said the group was considering a demerger into three separate divisions, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares climbed 6p to 110p by 0735 GMT in thin volume.</p>
</text>
